A gentleman 

I walked through the door of my apartment, to find bright flowers in a basket
on the dinner table waiting for me and plate with lemon cake cut into pieces on
on the chair I usually sat dream about him.His name was Matt, a true gentleman people 
would call him around town. He's tall, fit and loves like no other man. I have
no idea how he fell in love with me out of all women on this planet. He has his 
little cute ways to make me flustered in the most dark times of my life. Although
he saw the dreadful tears, he chose to stay and comfort me. A busy man yet he finds 
time to spend with me. Putting aside the things that's most important to him and focuses
on me instead. And that's the reason I fell in love with him. 